<suzuki><manual>
<section sectnbr = "1J">
<servcat sctnbr = "01" scnbr = "10">
<configtype typenbr = "2">
<servinfotype sitcode = "6">
<servinfo servinfosgmlid = "AENLSB0C1A26005" svcinfotypenbr = "08" svcinfoqualnbr = "01" page = "2" supplyoff = "1" modify = "0">
<title>
Generator Removal and Installation
</title>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0C1A26005001">
<title>
Removal
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Disconnect negative (–) cable at battery.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove intake manifold. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0C1426009"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove water pump / generator drive belt. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0C1A26004"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove water pump / generator drive belt auto tensioner. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0C1A26006"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove nut (1) and disconnect “B” terminal wire (3), and then disconnect generator connector (4) from generator (2).
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove generator upper bolt (5) and lower bolt (6) and then remove generator.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IFKA0P1A1005.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "61.211mm" ver = "01" gw = "211" gh = "157"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove water pump / generator drive belt adjusting arm, if necessary.
</ptxt>
</s1>
</servinfosub>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0C1A26005002">
<title>
Installation
</title>
<ptxt>
Reverse removal procedure noting the following points.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Tighten generator upper bolt (5) and lower bolt (6) as follows.
</ptxt>
</item>
<list2 type = "ordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Put generator (2) on cylinder block and tighten generator lower bolt temporarily.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Tighten generator upper bolt to specified torque.
</ptxt>
<torque>
<torqueitem id = "T1J221">
<t-part>
Generator upper bolt
</t-part>
<t-part1>
a
</t-part1>
<t-value1>
30
</t-value1>
<t-value2>
3.1
</t-value2>
<t-value3>
22.5
</t-value3>
</torqueitem>
</torque>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Tighten generator lower bolt to 30 N&#183;m (3.1 kgf-m, 22.5 lbf-ft) and check that bush (7) in generator bracket is in contact with cylinder block, and then loosen the bolt.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Tighten generator lower bolt to specified torque.
</ptxt>
<torque>
<torqueitem id = "T1J222">
<t-part>
Generator lower bolt
</t-part>
<t-part1>
b
</t-part1>
<t-value1>
48
</t-value1>
<t-value2>
4.9
</t-value2>
<t-value3>
35.5
</t-value3>
</torqueitem>
</torque>
</item>
</list2>
<item>
<ptxt>
Insert lugs (8) of “B” terminal wire (3) into groove (9) and then tighten “B” terminal nut (1) to specified torque.
</ptxt>
<torque>
<torqueitem id = "T1J223">
<t-part>
“B” terminal nut
</t-part>
<t-part1>
c
</t-part1>
<t-value1>
7.9
</t-value1>
<t-value2>
0.81
</t-value2>
<t-value3>
6.0
</t-value3>
</torqueitem>
</torque>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IFKA0P1A1006.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "90.827mm" ver = "01" gw = "215" gh = "241"/>
<callout>
<table frame = "all" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<tgroup cols = "2" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<colspec colnum = "1" colname = "1" colwidth = "0.315in"/>
<colspec colnum = "2" colname = "2" colwidth = "1.378in"/>
<tbody>
<row rowsep = "0">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
4.
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
Generator connector
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</callout>
</figure>
</item>
</list1>
</servinfosub>
</servinfo>
</servinfotype>
</configtype>
</servcat>
</section></manual></suzuki>
